    "text": "Hints : $C_1(5,0) \\quad r_1=\\sqrt{25-16}=3$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{C}_2(0,0) \\quad \\mathrm{r}_2=\\mathbf{a} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{r}_1 \\& \\mathrm{r}_2 < \\mathrm{C}_1 \\mathrm{C}_2 < \\mathrm{r}_1+\\mathrm{r}_2 \\\\\n& |\\mathbf{a}-3| < \\sqrt{25} < \\mathrm{a}+3 \\\\\n& |\\mathbf{a}-3| < 5 < \\mathrm{a}+3 \\\\\n& -5 < \\mathrm{a}-3 < 5 \\\\\n& -2 < \\mathrm{a} < 8 \\\\\n& 2 < \\mathrm{a} < 8\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
